  "text": "MedlinePlus Consumer Guide: Managing Tension Headaches | Publisher: US National Library of\nWhen Headaches Signal a Serious Problem\nSeek Urgent Medical Evaluation If: - Your headache occurs after a head\ninjury. - The headache is accompanied by fever, stiff neck, confusion, or\nspeech difficulty. - It is the 'worst headache of your life'\n(thunderclap). - Pain worsens despite rest and hydration after 48 hours.\nPage 2 of 4 | Official Educational Resource",
